Query 1: Find the Harbor Launch project + its documents.

```graphql
query {
  projects(filter: {name: {contains: "Harbor Launch"}}) {
    nodes {
      id
      name
      url
      documents(filter: {search: "Launch readiness checklist"}) {
        nodes {
          id
          title
          updatedAt
          lastEditor { name email }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

